# Finish the loop (detail)

Supplements **`dev-doctor.mdc` §3**. A feature is not done until checks have **run**, not been claimed.

Logic (`src/diagnostics`, `src-tauri/src`): add or update a unit test in the same change. Run `npm test`, `cargo test --manifest-path src-tauri/Cargo.toml`, and `npm run typecheck` if types changed.

UI: with `npm run tauri dev` up, drive the desktop window via **`debug-harness.mdc`**. Screenshot, read the image, exercise the control that changed. **Not** `localhost:1420` in a browser.

If a check fails, fix and re-run before reporting success.

Chrome spacing after title-row edits: menu toggle matches green button `y` and `height`; `headerHeight = zoom.y * 2 + zoom.height`; `left = zoom.x + zoom.width + 14`. Stop when two MCP screenshots show the same measurements — ask instead of nudging by eye.

In-app install fix still needs its own confirm dialog.

# Notes for the next task

When this task teaches a constraint not already in a rule, append one dated bullet to that rule's **Notes**. Rejected approach, measured value, or missing tool only — no transcript.
